d one mana of any color.")\nOther Pirates you control get +1/+1.', "When Departed Deckhand becomes the target of a spell, sacrifice it.\nDeparted Deckhand can't be blocked except by Spirits.\n{3}{U}: Another target creature you control can't be blocked this turn except by Spirits.", "When Dinrova Horror enters the battlefield, return target permanent to its owner's hand, then that player discards a card.", 'When Drainpipe Vermin dies, you may pay {B}. If you do, target player discards a card.', 'When Dutiful Attendant dies, return another target creature card from your graveyard to your hand.', "When Dwynen's Elite enters the battlefield, if you control another Elf, create a 1/1 green Elf Warrior creature token.", 'When Entomber Exarch enters the battlefield, choose one —\n• Return target creature card from your graveyard to your hand.\n• Target opponent reveals their hand. You choose a noncreature card from it. That player discards that card.', "When Exclusion Mage enters the battlefield, return target creature an opponent controls to its owner's hand.", 'When Feral Prowler dies, draw a card.', 'When Festering Newt dies, target creature an opponent controls gets -1/-1 until end of turn. That creature gets -4/-4 instead if you control a creature named Bogbrew Witch.', 'When Flametongue Kavu enters the battlefield, it deals 4 damage to target creature.', 'When Forge Devil enters the battlefield, it deals 1 damage to target creature and 1 damage to you.', 'When Ghoulraiser enters the battlefield, return a Zombie card at random from your graveyard to your hand.', 'When Goblin Commando enters the battlefield, it deals 2 damage to target creature.', 'When Goblin Instigator enters the battlefield, create a 1/1 red Goblin creature token.', "When Goblin Shortcutter enters the battlefield, target creature can't block this turn.", 'When Inspiring Captain enters the battlefield, creatures you control get +1/+1 until end of turn.', 'When Ironshell Beetle enters the battlefield, put a +1/+1 counter on target creature.', 'When Lawless Broker dies, put a +1/+1 counter on target creature you control.', "When Lena, Selfless Champion enters the battlefield, create a 1/1 white Soldier creature token for each nontoken creature you control.\nSacrifice Lena: Creatures you control with power less than Lena's power gain indestructible until end of turn.", 'When Living Lightning dies, return target instant or sorcery card from your graveyard to your hand.', 'When Mana Geode enters the battlefield, scry 1.\n{T}: Add one mana of any color.', "When Mausoleum Turnkey enters the battlefield, return target creature card of an opponent's choice from your graveyard to your hand.", 'When Meteor Golem enters the battlefield, destroy target nonland permanent an opponent controls.', 'When Miasmic Mummy enters the battlefield, each player discards a card.', 'When Muxus, Goblin Grandee enters the battlefield, reveal the top six cards of your library. Put all Goblin creature cards with mana value 5 or less from among them onto the battlefield and the rest on the bottom of your library in a random order.\nWhenever Muxus attacks, it gets +1/+1 until end of turn for each other Goblin you control.', 'When Myr Sire dies, create a 1/1 colorless Phyrexian Myr artifact creature token.', 'When Octoprophet enters the battlefield, scry 2. (Look at the top two cards of your library, then put any number of them on the bottom of your library and the rest on top in any order.)', 'When Penumbra Bobcat dies, create a 2/1 black Cat creature token.', 'When Perilous Myr dies, it deals 2 damage to any target.', 'When Phyrexian Gargantua enters the battlefield, you draw two cards and you lose 2 life.', 'When Phyrexian Rager enters the battlefield, you draw a card and you lose 1 life.', "When Pirate's Cutlass enters the battlefield, attach it to target Pirate you control.\nEquipped creature gets +2/+1.\nEquip {2} ({2}: Attach to target creature you control. Equip only as a sorcery.)", 'When Prophetic Prism enters the battlefield, draw a card.\n{1}, {T}: Add one mana of any color.', 'When Prosperous Pirates enters the battlefield, create two Treasure tokens. (They\'re artifacts with "{T}, Sacrifice this artifact: Add one mana of any color.")', 'When Ravenous Chupacabra enters the battlefield, destroy target creature an opponent controls.', 'When Rishkar, Peema Renegade enters the battlefield, put a +1/+1 counter on each of up to two target creatures.\nEach creature you control with a counter on it has "{T}: Add {G}."', 'When Runed Servitor dies, each player draws a card.', "When Sage's Row Savant enters the battlefield, scry 2.", 'When Sailor of Means enters the battlefield, create a Treasure token. (It\'s an artifact with "{T}, Sacrifice this artifact: Add one mana of any color.")', 'When Sea Gate Oracle enters the battlefield, look at the top two cards of your library. Put one of them into your hand and the other on the bottom of your library.', "When Seismic Elemental enters the battlefield, creatures without flying can't block this turn.", 'When Shambling Goblin dies, target creature an opponent controls gets -1/-1 until end of turn.', 'When Silhana Wayfinder enters the battlefield, look at the top four cards of your library. You may reveal a creature or land card from among them and put it on top of your library. Put the rest on the bottom of your library in a random order.', 'When Skittering Surveyor enters the battlefield, you may search your library for a basic land card, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle.', "When Somberwald Stag enters the battlefield, you may have it fight target creature you don't control.", 'When Supply Runners enters the battlefield, put a +1/+1 counter on each other creature you control.', 'When Sylvan Brushstrider enters the battlefield, you gain 2 life.', 'When Sylvan Ranger enters the battlefield, you may search your library for a basic land card, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle.', 'When Tempting Witch enters the battlefield, create a Food token. (It\'s an artifact with "{2}, {T}, Sacrifice this artifact: You gain 3 life.")\n{2}, {T}, Sacrifice a Food: Target player loses 3 life.', 'When Thragtusk enters the battlefield, you gain 5 life.\nWhen Thragtusk leaves the battlefield, create a 3/3 green Beast creature token.', "When Tibalt's Rager dies, it deals 1 damage to any target.\n{1}{R}: Tibalt's Rager gets +2/+0 until end of turn.", 'When Tithebearer Giant enters the battlefield, you draw a card and you lose 1 life.', 'When Trusty Retriever enters the battlefield, choose one —\n• Put a +1/+1 counter on Trusty Retriever.\n• Return target artifact or enchantment card from your graveyard to your hand.', 'When Volley Veteran enters the battlefield, it deals damage to target creature an opponent controls equal to the number of Goblins you control.', 'When Wailing Ghoul enters the battlefield, mill two cards.', 'When Warfire Javelineer enters the battlefield, it deals X damage to target creature an opponent controls, where X is the number of instant and sorcery cards in your graveyard.', 'When you next cast an instant or sorcery spell this turn, copy that spell. You may choose new targets for the copy.', 'Whenever Ashmouth Hound blocks or becomes blocked by a creature, Ashmouth Hound deals 1 damage to that creature.', 'Whenever Blood Artist or another creature dies, target opponent loses 1 life and you gain 1 life.', 'Whenever Blood Artist or another creature dies, target player loses 1 life and you gain 1 life.', 'Whenever Borderland Marauder attacks, it gets +2/+0 until end of turn.', "Whenever Etali, Primal Storm attacks, exile the top card of each player's library, then you may cast any number of spells from among those cards without paying their mana costs.", "Whenever Initiate's Companion deals combat damage to a player, untap target creature or land.", 'Whenever Inspiring Unicorn attacks, creatures you control get +1/+1 until end of turn.', 'Whenever Ornery Goblin blocks or becomes blocked by a creature, Ornery Goblin deals 1 damage to that creature.', 'Whenever Raging Regisaur attacks, it deals 1 damage to any target.', 'Whenever Selhoff Occultist or another creature dies, target player mills a card.', 'Whenever Sethron, Hurloon General or another nontoken Minotaur enters the battlefield under your control, create a 2/3 red Minotaur creature token.\n{2}{B/R}: Minotaurs you control get +1/+0 and gain menace and haste until end of turn. ({B/R} can be paid with either {B} or {R}.)', 'Whenever Slate Street Ruffian becomes blocked, defending player discards a card.', 'Whenever Stone Haven Pilgrim attacks, if you control an artifact or enchantment, Stone Haven Pilgrim gets +1/+1 and gains lifelink until end of turn.', 'Whenever Towering-Wave Mystic deals damage, target player mills that many cards.', 'Whenever a creature dies, Gristle Grinner gets +2/+2 until end of turn.', 'Whenever a creature dies, put a charge counter on Black Market.\nAt the beginning of your precombat main phase, add {B} for each charge counter on Black Market.', 'Whenever a creature enters the battlefield under your control, put a +1/+1 counter on each creature you control.', 'Whenever a creature you control deals combat damage to an opponent, you may draw a card.', 'Whenever an enchantment enters the battlefield under your control, create a 2/2 white Cat creature token. If that enchantment is an Aura, you may attach it to the token.', "Whenever an opponent casts a spell, reveal the top card of your library. If it's a creature card, put it onto the battlefield. Otherwise, you may put that card on the bottom of your library.", 'Whenever an opponent casts a spell, you may draw a card unless that player pays {1}.', 'Whenever an opponent draws their first card each turn, if it\'s not their turn, you create a 1/1 red Devil creature token with "When this creature dies, it deals 1 damage to any target."\nWhenever one or more Devils you control attack one or more players, you and those players each draw a card, then discard a card at random.', 'Whenever an opponent loses life, you gain that much life.', "Whenever another creature enters the battlefield, its controller may draw a card if its power is greater than each other creature's power.\n{G}, {T}: Add X mana in any combination of colors, where X is the greatest power among creatures you control.", "Whenever another creature enters the battlefield, you may put X +1/+1 counters on Hamletback Goliath, where X is that creature's power.", 'Whenever another creature with power 2 or less enters the battlefield under your control, you may pay {1}. If you do, draw a card.', 'Whenever another nontoken creature dies, you may create a 1/1 black Rat creature token.\nRats you control have deathtouch.', 'Whenever equipped creature deals combat damage to a player, you may draw a card.\nEquip {2} ({2}: Attach to target creature you control. Equip only as a sorcery.)', 'Whenever one or more creatures attack, you may have target attacking creature gain double strike until end of turn.', "Whenever one or more creatures you control fight or become blocked, draw a card.\nAt the beginning of combat on your turn, you may pay {2}{R/G}. If you do, double target creature's power until end of turn. That creature must be blocked this combat if able. ({R/G} can be paid with either {R} or {G}.)", 'Whenever one or more non-Human creatures you control deal combat damage to a player, draw a card.', "Whenever you cast a creature spell with power 4, 5, or 6, Sarkhan's Unsealing deals 4 damage to any target.\nWhenever you cast a creature spell with power 7 or greater, Sarkhan's Unsealing deals 4 damage to each opponent and each creature and planeswalker they control.", 'Whenever you cast a creature spell, create a 3/3 green Beast creature token.\nWhenever you cast a noncreature spell, put three +1/+1 counters on target creature you control.\nLandfall — Whenever a land enters the battlefield under your control, you gain 3 life.', 'Whenever you cast a creature spell, you may draw a card.', 'Whenever you cast a noncreature spell, Cathar\'s Companion gains indestructible until end of turn. (Damage and effects that say "destroy" don\'t destroy it.)', 'Whenever you cast an artifact spell, draw a card.', 'Whenever you cast an instant or sorcery spell, Kiln Fiend gets +3/+0 until end of turn.', 'Whenever you cast an instant or sorcery spell, create a 1/1 red Elemental creature token.', 'Whenever you cast an instant or sorcery spell, create a 2/2 blue Drake creature token with flying.', 'Whenever you gain life, Kalastria Nightwatch gains flying until end of turn.', 'Whenever you gain life, put a +1/+1 counter on Bloodbond Vampire.', 'Whenever you gain life, you may pay {1}{W}. If you do, put a +1/+1 counter on target creature for each 1 life you gained.', "Wight of Precinct Six gets +1/+1 for each creature card in your opponents' graveyards.", 'You draw two cards, lose 2 life, then mill two cards.', 'You may play an additional land on each of your turns.\nPlay with the top card of your library revealed.\nYou may play lands from the top of your library.', 'You may play an additional land this turn.\nDraw a card.', '{1}, Sacrifice Scroll of Avacyn: Draw a card. If you control an Angel, you gain 5 life.', '{1}, Sacrifice a Scarecrow: Draw a card.\n{4}, {T}: Return target artifact creature card from your graveyard to the battlefield.', '{1}, Sacrifice a creature: Put a +1/+1 counter on Phyrexian Broodlings.', '{1}, Sacrifice an artifact or creature: Makeshift Munitions deals 1 damage to any target.', '{1}, {T}, Sacrifice Chromatic Sphere: Add one mana of any color. Draw a card.', '{1}, {T}, Sacrifice a creature: You gain 4 life.\n{1}, {T}, Sacrifice a creature named Festering Newt: Each opponent loses 4 life. You gain life equal to the life lost this way.', '{1}{B}, Pay 2 life: Return target creature card from your graveyard to your hand.', '{1}{B}, Sacrifice another creature: Put a +1/+1 counter on Blood Host and you gain 2 life.', '{1}{R}{R}: Pyroclastic Elemental deals 1 damage to target player.', '{1}{U}, {T}: Draw a card, then discard a card.', '{1}{W}: Target creature you control gains lifelink until end of turn. (Damage dealt by the creature also causes its controller to gain that much life.)', '{2}, {T}: Each opponent loses 1 life and you gain 1 life.', '{2}, {T}: Search your library for a card named Festering Newt or Bubbling Cauldron, put it onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.', '{2}{B}, Sacrifice Corpse Hauler: Return another target creature card from your graveyard to your hand.', '{2}{B}, Sacrifice a creature: Target opponent reveals their hand. You choose a card from it. That player discards that card. Activate only as a sorcery.', '{2}{B}: Return Sanitarium Skeleton from your graveyard to your hand.', "{2}{G}: Target creature you control can't be blocked by creatures with power 2 or less this turn.", '{3}, {T}: Draw a card.', "{3}: Exile another target creature you control, then return it to the battlefield under its owner's control.\nWhenever another creature enters the battlefield under your control, you may pay {G/W}. If you do, put a +1/+1 counter on it. If it's a Unicorn, put two +1/+1 counters on it instead. ({G/W} can be paid with either {G} or {W}.)", '{3}: Jousting Dummy gets +1/+0 until end of turn.', "{3}{B}, Exile Ghoulcaller's Accomplice from your graveyard: Create a 2/2 black Zombie creature token. Activate only as a sorcery.", '{3}{U}{U}: Draw two cards.', '{5}, {T}, Sacrifice Lightning-Core Excavator: It deals 3 damage to any target.', '{8}: Target creature gets +5/+5 and gains trample until end of turn.', '{B}, Sacrifice a creature: Target creature gets -1/-1 until end of turn.', "{B}, {T}, Sacrifice another creature: Create X 2/2 black Zombie creature tokens, where X is the sacrificed creature's power.", '{G}, Sacrifice Dawntreader Elk: Search your library for a basic land card, put it onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.', '{R}, Sacrifice Torch Fiend: Destroy target artifact.', '{R}, Sacrifice a creature: Barrage of Expendables deals 1 damage to any target.', '{R}, {T}, Exile two cards from your graveyard: Grim Lavamancer deals 2 damage to any target.', '{R}: Molten Ravager gets +1/+0 until end of turn.', '{T}, Sacrifice Terramorphic Expanse: Search your library for a basic land card, put it onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.', '{T}: Add one mana of any color.', '{T}: Add one mana of any color.\n{T}: Target creature becomes the color or colors of your choice until end of turn.', "{T}: Add {C}.\n{1}{U}, {T}: Return target Wizard you control to its owner's hand.", '{T}: Add {C}.\n{2}, {T}, Sacrifice Buried Ruin: Return target artifact card from your graveyard to your hand.', '{T}: Add {C}.\n{7}, {T}, Sacrifice Unstable Obelisk: Destroy target permanent.', '{T}: Add {C}.\n{T}, Sacrifice a creature: Add {B}{B}.', "{T}: Add {C}.\n{T}: Put a charge counter on Mirrodin's Core.\n{T}, Remove a charge counter from Mirrodin's Core: Add one mana of any color.", '{T}: Add {C}{C}.\n{2}, {T}, Sacrifice Hedron Archive: Draw two cards.', '{T}: Add {C}{C}{C}.\n{3}, {T}, Sacrifice Dreamstone Hedron: Draw three cards.', '{T}: Add {G}.', "{T}: Bloodshot Trainee deals 4 damage to target creature. Activate only if Bloodshot Trainee's power is 4 or greater.", '{T}: Create X 1/1 red Goblin creature tokens, where X is the number of Goblins you control.', "{T}: Draw a card and reveal it. If it isn't a land card, discard it.", '{T}: Scry 1. (Look at the top card of your library. You may put that card on the bottom of your library.)', '{T}: Target player draws a card, then discards a card.', "{U}, Sacrifice Aether Spellbomb: Return target creature to its owner's hand.\n{1}, Sacrifice Aether Spellbomb: Draw a card.", '{U}, {T}: Target player mills two cards.', '{X}{R}, {T}, Sacrifice Cinder Elemental: It deals X damage to any target.']
